The ghosts is a list of 1, 0, 0, and 3.
The targetx is 0, while the targety is 1.
The pairs is 2, while the escape is 0.
Set escape to 1.
The mydistance is targetx plus targety.
For every ghost from 0 to pairs minus 1.
The ghostx is item (ghost times 2) of ghosts.
The ghosty is item (ghost times 2 plus 1) of ghosts.
The gapx is ghostx minus targetx.
If gapx is less than 0, set gapx to 0 minus gapx.
The gapy is ghosty minus targety.
If gapy is less than 0, set gapy to 0 minus gapy.
The theirdistance is gapx plus gapy.
If theirdistance is at most mydistance, set escape to 0.

If escape is 1, show true, otherwise show false.
